      "context": {
        "problem_id": "ae8a4818-853e-42d6-9308-246cde09f84f",
        "normalized_content": {
          "assets": [
            {
              "alt": "",
              "url": "/assets/c4d631d2-f62e-4a29-8a3b-1f025265659e",
              "kind": "ordinary_image",
              "asset_id": "c4d631d2-f62e-4a29-8a3b-1f025265659e",
              "asset_key": "image_1",
              "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"
            }
          ],
          "format": "teacherhelper-normalized",
          "sections": [
            {
              "key": "condition",
              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"c4d631d2-f62e-4a29-8a3b-1f025265659e\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/c4d631d2-f62e-4a29-8a3b-1f025265659e\"/>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> угол <var data-math-identifier=\"C\">C</var> равен 90°, угол <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var> равен 30°,  <span data-inline-latex=\"AB=2\\sqrt{3}\"></span> . Най­ди­те вы­со­ту <var data-math-identifier=\"CH\">CH</var>.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">1,5</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Решение\"><p>По­сле­до­ва­тель­но по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"CH = AC\\sin A = AB\\cos A\\sin A = 2\\sqrt{3}\\cos 30^\\circ\\sin 30^\\circ = 2\\sqrt{3}\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{2} = 1{,}5.\"></span></span></p></center></section><section data-content-kind=\"solution\" data-solution-title=\"Приведем другое решение\"><p>Катет, ле­жа­щий на­про­тив угла в 30°, равен по­ло­ви­не ги­по­те­ну­зы. Из тре­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> по­лу­ча­ем  <span data-inline-latex=\"BC=\\frac{AB}{2}=\\sqrt{3}\"></span> .  Угол <var data-math-identifier=\"HCB\">HCB</var> равен углу <var data-math-identifier=\"CAB\">CAB</var> по свой­ству вы­со­ты пря­мо­уголь­но­го тре­уголь­ни­ка, тогда из тре­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"HCB\">HCB</var> на­хо­дим  <span data-inline-latex=\"HB=\\frac{BC}{2}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\"></span> .  По тео­ре­ме Пи­фа­го­ра для тре­уголь­ни­ка <var data-math-identifier=\"HCB\">HCB</var>:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"CH=\\sqrt{BC^{2}-BH^{2}}=\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}-(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})^{2}}=\\sqrt{3-\\frac{3}{4}}=1{,}5\"></span>. </p></center></section>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
          "schema_version": 3,
          "problem_reference_ids": {
